{"id":"ecb9f43e837dcf35","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-computable-tree-embedding.md","title":"可计算完美树嵌入","display":"df-computable-tree-embedding — 可计算完美树嵌入","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-computable-tree-embedding","aliases":["20-df-computable-tree-embedding"],"display":"df-computable-tree-embedding — 可计算完美树嵌入","chapter":"9","section":"9.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"§9.6 的 isomorphic copy of 2<ω","source_printed_pages":[179,180],"source_pdf_pages":[211,212],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-computable-tree-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-computable-tree-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-tree-embedding — 可计算完美树嵌入"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§9.6 的 isomorphic copy of 2&lt;ω"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>179</span><span>180</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>211</span><span>212</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to T\">\\(g:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat g(\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma))=\\operatorname{code}(g(\\sigma))\">\\(\\widehat g(\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma))=\\operatorname{code}(g(\\sigma))\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable-tree-embedding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PerfectEmbed}(g,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\\widehat g\\in\\mathcal C_1\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\widehat g)=\\omega\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Longleftrightarrow g(\\sigma)\\preceq g(\\tau)]\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\ [g(\\sigma)\\prec g(\\sigma^\\frown0)\\land g(\\sigma)\\prec g(\\sigma^\\frown1)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable-tree-embedding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PerfectEmbed}(g,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\\widehat g\\in\\mathcal C_1\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\widehat g)=\\omega\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Longleftrightarrow g(\\sigma)\\preceq g(\\tau)]\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\ [g(\\sigma)\\prec g(\\sigma^\\frown0)\\land g(\\sigma)\\prec g(\\sigma^\\frown1)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 必须是向下闭合的二进制树；这个守卫在谓词的定义式中，所有仅假设 PerfectEmbed 的使用者都可取得它。值域只需是树内的序同构副本，不要求值域本身向下闭合或整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 都完美。若省略树条件，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\sigma)=0^\\frown\\sigma\">\\(g(\\sigma)=0^\\frown\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\operatorname{ran}(g)\">\\(T=\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\)</span>，虽满足原有的保序与严格增长条件，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 却没有空串，路径集为空，下游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in[T]\">\\(Y\\in[T]\\)</span> 立即失败。反向保序确保不同兄弟值不相容；严格增长保证从无限域路径得到无限值路径。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.6 的 isomorphic copy of 2&lt;ω；印刷页 179, 180；PDF 第 211, 212 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"g:2^{<\\omega}\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat g(\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma))=\\operatorname{code}(g(\\sigma))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable-tree-embedding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PerfectEmbed}(g,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\\widehat g\\in\\mathcal C_1\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\widehat g)=\\omega\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\ [\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\Longleftrightarrow g(\\sigma)\\preceq g(\\tau)]\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\ [g(\\sigma)\\prec g(\\sigma^\\frown0)\\land g(\\sigma)\\prec g(\\sigma^\\frown1)].","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"g(\\sigma)=0^\\frown\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\operatorname{ran}(g)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in[T]","display":false}],"bytes":1941,"backlinks":[{"id":"a2e45aeae7b65467","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]。"},{"id":"b650dc2733f4802d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]。"},{"id":"3bd2a42af0edd0d9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]] — 章 9；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]"}],"outgoing":["93a810534b87b0f9","e343870c773cb68e"]}